{"title":"Orc Warrior","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 20 Orc that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (1.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/orcish-grip-wrap\">Orcish Grip Wrap</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior?lv=20\">Lv 20</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>50</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>61</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior?lv=21\" title=\"Pick level 21\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>50</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Antlion%20Hive\">Antlion Hive</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>61</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Antlion%20Hive\">Antlion Hive</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior?lv=23\" title=\"Pick level 23\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"orc-warrior\" data-map-level=\"22\">Show level 22 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/9cbd76d9dddefef7ba8a.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/7a79d4ba8136e0732f4f.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Bearhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/c854049b58fc7fcf76a4.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Acid)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/e3627e7977ab984ee639.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/3102261c6bc1bf4a06b3.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Ice)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/56bcc8be9ccc1dd691fd.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Shock)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/9cbd76d9dddefef7ba8a.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 12 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 12 looted corpses, 58 recorded drops, 1,971 total, 13–97 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/12</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 42% of 12 looted corpses, 5 recorded drops, 26 total, 3–7 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">42% · 5/12</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-legs\" title=\"Silver Legs - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/08ecaf2ee25350d177fd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-arms\" title=\"Silver Arms - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0df60d482adab9e8f138.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+5 more\">+5 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snakeskin-torso\" title=\"Snakeskin Torso - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/369f38cef692acd31f9d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snakeskin Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gem-sapphire\" title=\"Gem Sapphire - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2220daf9c672592009e9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gem Sapphire</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-medium\" title=\"Stamina Potion Medium - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/df992b2657b50a24d683.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-medium\" title=\"Mana Potion Medium - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dce7b61a763deccad88f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-medium\" title=\"Health Potion Medium - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6003f0952eddf298b4c8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Grask&#39;s Warren</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 20</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-211\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-271.9px,-1380.5px)\"><img src=\"tiles/4/0/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/0/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/1/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/1/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:1280px\"><i style=\"left:281.4px;top:1413.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:264.1px;top:1312.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:228.9px;top:1370.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:288.3px;top:1379.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:265.4px;top:1375.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:212.6px;top:1337.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:310.1px;top:1403.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:185.6px;top:1361.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:261.9px;top:1330.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:385.9px;top:1365.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:307.4px;top:1378.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:389.9px;top:1356.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:346.8px;top:1376.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:291.1px;top:1316.7